{"id":"sredi","lemma":"среди","pos":"prep","rank":497,"glosses":["among, in the midst of"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f5/Ru-%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы среди друзей.","en":"We're among friends.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Я люблю быть среди людей.","en":"I like to be around people.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"}]},{"text":"Том среди финалистов?","en":"Is Tom one of the finalists?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null]},{"text":"Убийца находится среди нас.","en":"The killer is among us.","words":[{"g":"murderer"},{"g":"to be found","l":"находиться"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Он был среди этих избранных.","en":"He was among those chosen.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null,null]}]}